  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“It’s all about the right application of energy.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Kinetic blast class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Energy blasts can be readied to counterspell any evocation spell of their effective spell level or lower, and physical blasts can be readied to counterspell any conjuration (creation) spell of their effective spell level or lower.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> Negative blast can counterspell necromancy spells rather than evocation, and telekinetic blast can counterspell transmutation and conjuration (teleportation) spells rather than conjuration (creation).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc32\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
